irmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"リターニア王国の女王。 女王と呼ぶにはまだ若すぎる年齢だが、逝去した先代の王に代わり、王国を統治している。 お転婆かつ破天荒な性格で、側近の者たちはその王族らしからぬ振る舞いにいつも頭を痛めている。 だがその一方で、民の安全と王国の平和をいかなる時も第一に考えている名君でもある。 下ネタに対する抵抗が一切無く、卑猥な言葉を恥ずかしげもなくシレッと言い放つ。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"13199","sourceWorkId":"23728","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"リターニア王国の女王。 女王と呼ぶにはまだ若すぎる年齢だが、逝去した先代の王に代わり、王国を統治している。 お転婆かつ破天荒な性格で、側近の者たちはその王族らしからぬ振る舞いにいつも頭を痛めている。 だがその一方で、民の安全と王国の平和をいかなる時も第一に考えている名君でもある。 下ネタに対する抵抗が一切無く、卑猥な言葉を恥ずかしげもなくシレッと言い放つ。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"48428"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/c2/c2f808d2bb7690754bf6c6f7c252b6d632e03a65b63779c94e4b2f6c91cd60c1.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/1a/1a56798818589f4c91c3da12c7b92f7780b1b1357e19a48a0e5f7a7946651376.webp","width":228,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"平松真奈実","creatorId":"vndb:s857","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s857","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s857","name":"平松 真奈実","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:197682:48428:19253:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c57906","characterName":"サラ","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"48429","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"197682"}],"egsCharacterIds":["13200"],"vndbCharacterId":"c57906"},"originalCharacterName":"サラ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Queen Sylvia's confidante. Her youth belies her status as one of Ritaania's most important administrators."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Despite an introverted personality, she is a scholar well versed in history, politics, magic and many other fields and is thus highly rated by Sylvia for her abilities."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Resolving the troubles caused by the extroverted and impetuous Sylvia is a daily chore for Sara."},{"spoiler":true,"text":"Her real name is Cecilia Eve Ritaania (セシリア・イヴ・リターニア), the illegitimate of the previous king of Ritaania and his concubine. The Queen's jealousy led to her mother's death and forced Cecilia to flee her home. Eventually she was taken in by an old man who was the latest in a long line of demon masters. He offered to teach Sara all he knew as he acknowledged the darkness within her and was convinced that generations of demon summoning would be put to world-changing effect by Sara. After Sara completed her studies, she summoned the Demon Lord Belial whom the Spirit Master had defeated 500 years before and proceeded to commence her quest for revenge."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c57906"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"シルヴィアの側近で、若くしてリターニア王国の幹部にまで上り詰めた人物。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"内気な性格ながらも、歴史、政治、魔法等のあらゆる分野の知識に精通している博学者で、シルヴィアからその能力を高く評価されている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"破天荒なシルヴィアに日夜振り回されている苦労人。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"13200","sourceWorkId":"23728","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"シルヴィアの側近で、若くしてリターニア王国の幹部にまで上り詰めた人物。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"内気な性格ながらも、歴史、政治、魔法等のあらゆる分野の知識に精通している博学者で、シルヴィアからその能力を高く評価されている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"破天荒なシルヴィアに日夜振り回されている苦労人。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"48429"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/a2/a27f6807f18918aeedb10901d62fe91fb54ab04c7f48756191baf47061f6ec24.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/52/52c96d397321b2e9aed33325312032f9dac49aa278dc7549cf0784eafa52d7cd.webp","width":